  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A VRCAnimatorTrackingControl configured for Left Fingers = Animation and Right Fingers = Animation does not produce the same result when its state is entered as the default state after Reset Avatar as it does when the Animator transitions back into that state at runtime.\n\nImmediately after resetting the avatar while the controlling Bool is false, skeletal hand tracking remains active and the fingers move smoothly.\n\nIf the Bool is then switched true and false, causing the Animator to transition from the Tracking state back into the Animation state, the avatar’s custom finger animations take priority as expected.\n\nThis behavior was reproduced consistently.\n\nExpected result\n\nEntering the default Animation state after Reset Avatar should produce the same finger-control result as transitioning back into that same state at runtime.",
